  "limitations": [
    "One-variable Year7 equations have natural-number solutions; Year8 permits signed/rational equations",
    "Year8 index practice rejects negative displayed/result exponents; Year9 removes that restriction",
    "Four-operation fraction/decimal drills do not cover every rational-number modelling context",
    "Coordinate practice covers translations only, not reflections and rotations",
    "Right-prism practice covers cuboids only, not triangular prisms",
    "Circle calculations use stated3.14 approximation, not the full pi/representation investigation",
    "Time practice covers one June journey and12/24 notation; multiple time zones remain",
    "Statistics practice covers mean, median and mode only; range and data investigations remain",
    "Quadratic exercises include coefficient-one factorisation and other algebraic forms; plotting/numerical solution investigations remain",
    "Probability calculations are selected equal-likelihood/independence/conditional forms; full sample-space diagrams and live experiments remain",
    "Log practice uses exact powers of ten, not arbitrary logarithmic scales",
    "Right-angle height practice currently uses45 degrees; broader trig modelling remains",
    "Normal1080x2400 emulator phone; small phones, tablets, physical devices and TalkBack learning access remain",
    "Only four representative algebra types exercised natively, not all126 grade placements",
    "Initial40 used pre-correction English captions; only the additional10 verify authored root captions",
    "38 mapped types have some static concept descriptions without entered step scaffolds",
    "No full curriculum, student-effectiveness or external visual-review completion",
    "Each secondary placement issued100 tasks;26 samples had fewer than100 distinct visible prompts, with a smallest categorical domain of3",
    "Existing saved pack id is retained; adding national levels is not a claim for state syllabuses or Years11\u201312",
    "Global curricula, localization, age/bear design, long sessions, advertising/purchase and release remain unfinished"
  ]
